  "rationale": "We are escalating this claim because the total amount of loss meets the referral threshold requiring senior adjuster review. Section [BASIC-6.1] governs high-value claims by stating that any claim where the amount of loss is at or above $15,000 must be escalated. The key fact is that the total itemized damage is $15,040.00.",
  "citations": [
